      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm trying to set up some reorder logic for our shop. we sell a lot of lithium-ion battery components and sometimes we run out right when we need them most. can you help me figure out a formula for setting safety stock levels so we don't hit zero during peak periods? i have the lead times and average daily usage, but i'm not sure how to account for the variability.",
